cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Milgram Obedience Experiment: An Agent-Based Model"
abstract: >-
  An open, interactive agent-based model exploring the relationship between
  Milgram's obedience experiments, computational modelling, model
  assumptions, and reproducibility. Built with the Mesa agent-based
  modelling framework, with an interactive Streamlit application and a
  reproducible batch experiment.
